1
00:01:41,770 --> 00:01:49,020
[Genius Girlfriend]

2
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:51,840
[Episode 22]

3
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:06,620
You're burning up.

4
00:02:07,500 --> 00:02:09,090
Can't you give me a break?

5
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:11,610
First a fever, and now a broken leg.

6
00:02:12,180 --> 00:02:12,870
I told you

7
00:02:12,910 --> 00:02:14,360
not to stay up late.

8
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:15,310
Why didn't you listen?

9
00:02:15,310 --> 00:02:16,510
Tell me what to do now.

10
00:02:16,620 --> 00:02:18,140
How do I explain to our parents? Tell me.

11
00:02:18,140 --> 00:02:19,950
Zeqiu, we're in the hospital.

12
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:21,860
[Ward Staff Code of Conduct]

13
00:02:25,430 --> 00:02:27,560
And I just sprained and fractured it.

14
00:02:28,130 --> 00:02:29,060
It's not broken.

15
00:02:29,780 --> 00:02:31,560
Can you not tell Mom and Dad?

16
00:02:33,210 --> 00:02:34,560
I promise this won't happen again.

17
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:35,860
Lie back down.

18
00:02:37,340 --> 00:02:39,780
[Ward Staff Code of Conduct]

19
00:02:39,079 --> 00:02:41,280
It'd be best if you could keep your word.

20
00:02:48,270 --> 00:02:49,800
When will the fever go down?

21
00:02:51,079 --> 00:02:53,010
It should go down after the IV drip.

22
00:02:54,020 --> 00:02:54,990
I need an IV?

23
00:03:00,860 --> 00:03:01,920
She hates needles.

24
00:03:04,210 --> 00:03:04,570
Then,

25
00:03:05,580 --> 00:03:07,440
can she take oral fever medicine?

26
00:03:07,930 --> 00:03:08,350
No.

27
00:03:09,340 --> 00:03:10,590
She's already severely overdrawn.

28
00:03:10,590 --> 00:03:12,640
Oral medication will irritate
her stomach too much.

29
00:03:12,640 --> 00:03:13,260
Besides,

30
00:03:13,350 --> 00:03:15,350
she can sleep well after the IV drip.

31
00:03:19,370 --> 00:03:19,900
Zeqiu...

32
00:03:23,310 --> 00:03:24,170
Jiang Yubai...

33
00:03:32,130 --> 00:03:32,970
It's my fault.

34
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:35,980
I should have worked overtime
with our team leader.

35
00:03:37,150 --> 00:03:38,210
I should be blamed.

36
00:03:38,690 --> 00:03:41,630
If I didn't keep complaining about
possibly delaying graduation,

37
00:03:41,630 --> 00:03:43,490
she wouldn't have worked so hard.

38
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:47,620
Why don't we go to the hospital
to see her now?

39
00:03:48,290 --> 00:03:48,840
Enough.

40
00:03:49,860 --> 00:03:52,340
The last thing Zhixia needs right now
is to be bothered.

41
00:03:52,340 --> 00:03:54,000
Her brother is there with her.

42
00:03:54,170 --> 00:03:55,630
If you really want to help,

43
00:03:55,660 --> 00:03:57,990
hurry up and finish the data calculation.

44
00:04:05,900 --> 00:04:06,910
Is there anything else you need?

45
00:04:06,910 --> 00:04:08,040
I'll go buy it later.

46
00:04:08,620 --> 00:04:09,150
No need.

47
00:04:09,430 --> 00:04:12,030
Dr. Shen has bought
all the daily necessities,

48
00:04:12,030 --> 00:04:13,960
and told us to take good care of her.

49
00:04:14,350 --> 00:04:15,080
Don't worry.

50
00:04:15,650 --> 00:04:16,850
I'll get back to work.

51
00:04:23,460 --> 00:04:24,860
What do you want for dinner?

52
00:04:24,860 --> 00:04:25,920
I'll go prepare it.

53
00:04:26,580 --> 00:04:27,580
No need to bother.

54
00:04:27,830 --> 00:04:30,200
The hospital has nutritious meals
for patients.

55
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:31,730
I've arranged everything.

56
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:34,780
Thanks for your hard work.

57
00:04:34,780 --> 00:04:36,810
With you here, it saves a lot of trouble.

58
00:04:36,810 --> 00:04:38,140
You're welcome, Zeqiu.

59
00:04:38,630 --> 00:04:40,400
Zeqiu, rest assured.

60
00:04:40,750 --> 00:04:41,810
Go do your own thing.

61
00:04:41,810 --> 00:04:42,930
You still have work.

62
00:04:42,930 --> 00:04:44,180
How can I rest assured?

63
00:04:44,180 --> 00:04:45,780
You can't even get out of bed.

64
00:04:46,810 --> 00:04:47,450
Shall we

65
00:04:48,159 --> 00:04:49,000
hire a caregiver for you?

66
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:49,500
No need.

67
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:52,810
I'll always be here.

68
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:56,190
Shen has work to do, too.

69
00:04:56,190 --> 00:04:57,390
He must be quite busy.

70
00:04:57,890 --> 00:04:59,420
How about I take care of her instead?

71
00:04:59,420 --> 00:05:02,020
My schedule happens to be
quite flexible, too.

72
00:05:10,300 --> 00:05:10,900
Well,

73
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:12,340
all right then.

74
00:05:13,950 --> 00:05:16,980
I'll leave Lin Zhixia in your hands then.

75
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:22,480
Jia.

76
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:28,080
I bought some food and drinks
for everyone.

77
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,160
Thank you, Dr. Shen.

78
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:30,240
Come and get your milk tea.

79
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:31,320
Dr. Shen's treat.

80
00:05:31,570 --> 00:05:32,270
So nice.

81
00:05:33,930 --> 00:05:36,250
Dr. Shen,
is there anything you need us for?

82
00:05:36,250 --> 00:05:37,409
You're usually so serious,

83
00:05:37,409 --> 00:05:38,810
you never even talk to us.

84
00:05:39,820 --> 00:05:40,670
Please take

85
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:42,520
good care of Lin Zhixia in bed 11.

86
00:05:44,870 --> 00:05:47,070
If she needs anything, just let me know.

87
00:05:48,950 --> 00:05:49,880
Dr. Shen,

88
00:05:49,950 --> 00:05:51,550
you are being so thoughtful.

89
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:53,220
Could she be your girlfriend?

90
00:05:53,300 --> 00:05:54,250
Of course.

91
00:05:54,460 --> 00:05:56,330
Otherwise, how would we be
benefiting from this?

92
00:05:56,330 --> 00:05:57,740
Dr. Shen, does your girlfriend know

93
00:05:57,740 --> 00:05:59,870
that you are so thoughtful toward her?

94
00:06:02,980 --> 00:06:04,400
Dr. Shen, you normally seem so serious,

95
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:05,500
but you're actually a sweetheart.

96
00:06:05,500 --> 00:06:06,630
Thanks for the help.

97
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:09,480
I want to drink this.

98
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:10,420
This one.

99
00:06:10,700 --> 00:06:11,460
This is good.

100
00:06:15,930 --> 00:06:16,530
Director.

101
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:19,860
I would like to request

102
00:06:19,890 --> 00:06:21,820
to work the night shift for a while.

103
00:06:22,860 --> 00:06:24,390
Do you want to take time off?

104
00:06:24,960 --> 00:06:25,730
No.

105
00:06:26,190 --> 00:06:28,320
I can just work the night shift lately.

106
00:06:28,430 --> 00:06:29,680
If the schedule can't be adjusted,

107
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:31,210
I can just cover for others.

108
00:06:34,030 --> 00:06:36,630
I heard a friend of yours
is hospitalized here.

109
00:06:40,390 --> 00:06:40,870
Okay.

110
00:06:41,659 --> 00:06:44,060
Then you can cover
the night shifts for now.

111
00:06:44,250 --> 00:06:44,790
But

112
00:06:44,820 --> 00:06:46,480
don't let it affect your work.

113
00:06:46,870 --> 00:06:47,810
Thank you, Director.

114
00:06:47,810 --> 00:06:48,740
You're welcome.

115
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:53,120
Don't worry, Tingting.

116
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:54,070
I'm really fine.

117
00:06:55,110 --> 00:06:57,240
I'll be discharged in a couple of days.

118
00:06:57,430 --> 00:06:58,860
Tell Duan Qiyan too.

119
00:07:00,090 --> 00:07:00,690
Got it.

120
00:07:01,310 --> 00:07:01,790
Bye.

121
00:07:04,890 --> 00:07:05,480
These two

122
00:07:06,490 --> 00:07:08,890
have been blowing up
the group chat all day.

123
00:07:09,100 --> 00:07:10,530
It's no big deal anyway.

124
00:07:10,620 --> 00:07:12,150
Everyone is busy with work.

125
00:07:12,180 --> 00:07:13,220
I don't want to bother them.

126
00:07:13,220 --> 00:07:15,180
But what about the school?

127
00:07:16,750 --> 00:07:18,100
While I'm in the hospital,

128
00:07:18,100 --> 00:07:20,100
what will Luo Ying and the others do?

129
00:07:20,390 --> 00:07:22,790
There's still so much to do
for the project.

130
00:07:23,060 --> 00:07:23,990
There's no rush.

131
00:07:24,460 --> 00:07:26,590
Take these two days to sort things out.

132
00:07:27,220 --> 00:07:30,280
Even when rushing,
you need to look where you're going.

133
00:07:39,460 --> 00:07:41,320
Visiting hours have long passed.

134
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:42,890
The patient needs rest.

135
00:07:43,540 --> 00:07:44,670
Zeqiu already left.

136
00:07:45,570 --> 00:07:46,830
You should go back too.

137
00:07:50,500 --> 00:07:52,130
I'll be so bored.

138
00:07:52,870 --> 00:07:53,600
You won't be.

139
00:07:54,180 --> 00:07:55,180
You need to sleep.

140
00:07:58,440 --> 00:07:59,560
Dr. Shen,

141
00:08:00,390 --> 00:08:02,870
are you always this serious at work?

142
00:08:08,690 --> 00:08:09,380
Today,

143
00:08:10,100 --> 00:08:11,360
I'm on the night shift.

144
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:17,310
Okay.

145
00:08:19,130 --> 00:08:19,710
Then

146
00:08:21,190 --> 00:08:22,390
I'll head back first.

147
00:08:39,610 --> 00:08:48,140
[Inpatient]

148
00:09:22,830 --> 00:09:28,120
[Inpatient]

149
00:09:33,610 --> 00:09:38,900
[Inpatient]

150
00:09:37,870 --> 00:09:40,070
I still want to check today's progress.

151
00:09:40,580 --> 00:09:42,710
Otherwise, I won't have peace of mind.

152
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:43,760
Lin Zhixia,

153
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:46,100
we all know what we need to do.

154
00:09:46,420 --> 00:09:48,270
You also need to know what you should do.

155
00:09:48,270 --> 00:09:50,980
Your top priority right now is to recover.

156
00:09:52,130 --> 00:09:53,980
Don't talk to me about the project
until you're healed.

157
00:09:53,980 --> 00:09:55,710
I won't reply to your messages.

158
00:09:55,870 --> 00:09:56,730
Go to sleep now.

159
00:09:57,580 --> 00:09:57,970
Bye.

160
00:10:12,640 --> 00:10:14,460
You should put your phone down now

161
00:10:14,460 --> 00:10:15,610
and go to sleep.

162
00:10:16,300 --> 00:10:16,960
Good night.

163
00:10:18,900 --> 00:10:19,700
Got it.

164
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:20,860
Good night.

165
00:11:17,660 --> 00:11:19,950
[Inpatient]

166
00:11:20,640 --> 00:11:22,310
Her eyes are so big.

167
00:11:22,790 --> 00:11:23,720
Did you see that?

168
00:11:26,800 --> 00:11:28,460
What's wrong? What happened?

169
00:11:28,870 --> 00:11:29,670
It's nothing.

170
00:11:29,890 --> 00:11:30,670
Everyone wants to see

171
00:11:30,670 --> 00:11:32,870
what Dr. Shen's girlfriend looks like.

172
00:11:33,460 --> 00:11:34,260
Girlfriend?

173
00:11:34,790 --> 00:11:36,340
She is so elegant.

174
00:11:36,740 --> 00:11:38,380
What a perfect match.

175
00:11:38,890 --> 00:11:41,140
No wonder he was looking for people
to swap shifts with last night.

176
00:11:41,140 --> 00:11:42,410
Looking at this schedule,

177
00:11:42,410 --> 00:11:45,270
he'll probably be staying
at the hospital all week.

178
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:46,140
Excuse me.

179
00:11:46,540 --> 00:11:47,270
May I ask

180
00:11:47,640 --> 00:11:49,440
where I can borrow a wheelchair?

181
00:11:49,460 --> 00:11:51,590
At the cashier in the outpatient hall.

182
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:53,600
Thank you.

183
00:11:56,290 --> 00:11:57,220
She's so pretty.

184
00:12:09,350 --> 00:12:10,800
L-L-L-L-Lin Zhixia.

185
00:12:11,140 --> 00:12:12,470
Look what I brought you.

186
00:12:13,280 --> 00:12:15,010
How are you? Did you sleep well?

187
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:15,790
Not bad.

188
00:12:16,150 --> 00:12:17,280
I'm just a bit bored.

189
00:12:20,170 --> 00:12:21,750
Why did you get a wheelchair?

190
00:12:21,750 --> 00:12:24,200
I knew you couldn't stay still
in the ward.

191
00:12:24,930 --> 00:12:26,260
Check out your new ride.

192
00:12:28,500 --> 00:12:30,740
Want me to take you
downstairs for some fresh air?

193
00:12:30,740 --> 00:12:31,200
Really?

194
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:38,600
But the nurse said
I still need an IV drip later.

195
00:12:39,220 --> 00:12:41,080
The doctor probably won't agree.

196
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:44,650
Just for a little while.

197
00:12:45,260 --> 00:12:46,260
It should be fine.

198
00:12:51,470 --> 00:12:55,530
[Inpatient]

199
00:12:52,100 --> 00:12:54,700
I wonder how long it will take
for my leg to heal.

200
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:57,010
I really want to go skateboarding.

201
00:12:58,910 --> 00:13:00,240
You want to skateboard?

202
00:13:01,550 --> 00:13:03,280
I like the feeling of freedom

203
00:13:03,630 --> 00:13:04,960
with the wind in my face.

204
00:13:07,500 --> 00:13:09,160
You can feel it right now, too.

205
00:13:09,670 --> 00:13:10,270
Sit tight.

206
00:13:11,580 --> 00:13:12,410
Here we go!

207
00:13:17,120 --> 00:13:18,460
Flying!

208
00:13:19,130 --> 00:13:19,730
Drifting!

209
00:13:21,470 --> 00:13:22,050
Charge!

210
00:13:45,870 --> 00:13:46,530
Lin Zhixia!

211
00:13:51,770 --> 00:13:52,830
What are you doing?

212
00:13:52,980 --> 00:13:53,780
Are you crazy?

213
00:13:54,980 --> 00:13:55,950
Trying to fly?

214
00:13:57,490 --> 00:13:58,440
The readings?

215
00:13:58,700 --> 00:13:59,580
Systolic 110,

216
00:13:59,580 --> 00:14:00,440
diastolic 75.

217
00:14:03,270 --> 00:14:05,220
Tell me why I saw Dr. Shen's girlfriend

218
00:14:05,220 --> 00:14:06,820
hanging out with another man

219
00:14:06,890 --> 00:14:08,530
and having a great time?

220
00:14:08,770 --> 00:14:09,690
I don't know.

221
00:14:10,210 --> 00:14:13,410
I heard he was waiting at
the ward door early in the morning,

222
00:14:13,410 --> 00:14:15,040
even earlier than Dr. Shen.

223
00:14:15,820 --> 00:14:16,820
Wait, then what about Dr. Shen?

224
00:14:16,820 --> 00:14:19,170
What nonsense are you talking about?

225
00:14:19,850 --> 00:14:22,500
That lady can't be Dr. Shen's girlfriend.

226
00:14:23,010 --> 00:14:23,980
No way.

227
00:14:24,440 --> 00:14:26,430
I heard that when people asked Dr. Shen,

228
00:14:26,430 --> 00:14:27,890
he didn't deny it himself.

229
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:29,730
Did he admit it personally?

230
00:14:31,150 --> 00:14:32,380
Not exactly.

231
00:14:33,620 --> 00:14:34,630
There you have it.

232
00:15:05,560 --> 00:15:06,440
Jiang Yubai.

233
00:15:06,800 --> 00:15:08,620
When did your IQ get so low?

234
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:14,120
How childish!

235
00:15:14,320 --> 00:15:16,770
[Inpatient]

236
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:16,820
What's so fun about a wheelchair?

237
00:15:18,030 --> 00:15:19,510
Zeqiu, it was my idea.

238
00:15:19,620 --> 00:15:21,080
Where did all your smarts go?

239
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:22,340
What if you fall again?

240
00:15:22,650 --> 00:15:23,720
Don't you want your leg?

241
00:15:23,720 --> 00:15:25,650
Want to be in a wheelchair for life?

242
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:29,280
Stop fooling around.

243
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:31,060
Go back!

244
00:15:35,750 --> 00:15:38,500
[Inpatient]

245
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:41,710
With a combined IQ of almost 400,

246
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:43,130
you chose to do this.

247
00:15:43,690 --> 00:15:45,290
Is this what adults would do?

248
00:15:46,010 --> 00:15:46,740
So childish.

249
00:15:50,700 --> 00:15:51,840
Instead of cooking her something good,

250
00:15:51,840 --> 00:15:53,970
you pushed her around in a wheelchair.

251
00:16:16,340 --> 00:16:17,100
Dr. Shen.

252
00:16:19,730 --> 00:16:20,530
What's wrong?

253
00:16:23,650 --> 00:16:25,190
Are you in a bad mood?

254
00:16:28,710 --> 00:16:29,840
Come on, breathe in.

255
00:16:34,940 --> 00:16:35,670
Breathe out.

256
00:16:39,480 --> 00:16:40,100
I'm not.

257
00:16:41,420 --> 00:16:42,730
Don't lie to me.

258
00:16:43,280 --> 00:16:45,650
You went to the orthopedics
department first thing in the morning,

259
00:16:45,650 --> 00:16:47,280
and someone else did my checkup.

260
00:16:47,280 --> 00:16:47,740
What?

261
00:16:48,610 --> 00:16:50,700
Are you not going to
take care of me anymore?

262
00:16:50,700 --> 00:16:51,360
Breathe in.

263
00:16:54,530 --> 00:16:55,260
Breathe out.

264
00:16:58,170 --> 00:16:58,650
No.

265
00:17:02,750 --> 00:17:03,610
Who's that guy?

266
00:17:06,420 --> 00:17:07,020
Which one?

267
00:17:07,569 --> 00:17:09,010
The tall, handsome one

268
00:17:09,770 --> 00:17:11,700
playing with Zhixia in the garden.

269
00:17:13,510 --> 00:17:14,310
Why do you ask?

270
00:17:16,569 --> 00:17:17,900
Is he your rival in love?

271
00:17:23,700 --> 00:17:24,790
What's going on

272
00:17:25,970 --> 00:17:27,920
in that little head of yours all day?

273
00:17:27,920 --> 00:17:28,910
Gossip.

274
00:17:29,740 --> 00:17:31,250
Otherwise, it's so boring.

275
00:17:31,250 --> 00:17:32,870
People only started spreading rumors
yesterday

276
00:17:32,870 --> 00:17:34,420
that Zhixia is your girlfriend.

277
00:17:34,420 --> 00:17:36,450
And today, he made such a big scene

278
00:17:36,470 --> 00:17:38,270
like he wanted everyone to know.

279
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:41,230
You two peacocks are really

280
00:17:41,530 --> 00:17:43,530
showing off your courtship skills.

281
00:17:45,860 --> 00:17:46,810
You know it all.

282
00:17:48,610 --> 00:17:49,810
Then in your opinion,

283
00:17:50,240 --> 00:17:51,570
who is better, him or me?

284
00:17:52,420 --> 00:17:54,520
Of course he is...

285
00:17:56,700 --> 00:17:57,700
Not as good as you.

286
00:18:02,350 --> 00:18:03,350
You're young,

287
00:18:03,630 --> 00:18:05,480
but you're quite good at flattery.

288
00:18:05,480 --> 00:18:06,540
It's not flattery.

289
00:18:15,500 --> 00:18:16,980
Have a glass of water first.

290
00:18:16,980 --> 00:18:18,100
I'll go wash the vegetables.

291
00:18:18,100 --> 00:18:18,850
Make yourself at home.

292
00:18:18,850 --> 00:18:19,270
Okay.

293
00:18:34,800 --> 00:18:37,290
[Astronomy Enthusiast]

294
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:44,240
That's the Winter Triangle.

295
00:18:45,220 --> 00:18:46,620
Next to it is the Hexagon.

296
00:18:47,030 --> 00:18:49,440
Among them, Sirius, the closest one to us,

297
00:18:49,590 --> 00:18:51,050
is slowly approaching us.

298
00:18:53,050 --> 00:18:54,850
Why did the meteors stop moving?

299
00:18:55,180 --> 00:18:56,640
Weren't you making a wish?

300
00:18:56,790 --> 00:18:57,850
I paused it for you.

301
00:19:24,530 --> 00:19:25,660
Do you need any help?

302
00:19:26,510 --> 00:19:28,010
No, I can do it myself.

303
00:19:28,830 --> 00:19:29,790
Just make yourself comfortable

304
00:19:29,790 --> 00:19:30,660
and wait to eat.

305
00:19:34,350 --> 00:19:34,950
By the way,

306
00:19:35,160 --> 00:19:36,940
did you check on
Lin Zhixia this afternoon?

307
00:19:36,940 --> 00:19:38,200
Is she feeling better?

308
00:19:39,160 --> 00:19:41,200
It makes me mad just talking about it.

309
00:19:41,200 --> 00:19:42,800
Jiang Yubai is also an idiot.

310
00:19:43,030 --> 00:19:44,140
He took Lin Zhixia downstairs

311
00:19:44,140 --> 00:19:47,000
in a wheelchair and pushed her
around like a maniac.

312
00:19:47,830 --> 00:19:49,660
That means she's probably fine now.

313
00:19:49,660 --> 00:19:50,240
If something goes wrong again,

314
00:19:50,240 --> 00:19:52,370
I won't be able to answer
to my parents.

315
00:19:52,720 --> 00:19:53,920
They're like two kids.

316
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:56,050
Neither of them gives me peace of mind.

317
00:19:56,160 --> 00:19:56,620
Oh yeah,

318
00:19:56,980 --> 00:19:58,240
weren't you classmates with Jiang Yubai

319
00:19:58,240 --> 00:19:59,740
and Shen Fuxuan?

320
00:20:01,440 --> 00:20:02,440
The two of them...

321
00:20:03,880 --> 00:20:04,770
How should I put it?

322
00:20:04,770 --> 00:20:05,700
They're a bit...

323
00:20:06,140 --> 00:20:07,370
A bit weird.

324
00:20:09,050 --> 00:20:10,380
What's wrong with them?

325
00:20:10,890 --> 00:20:13,150
They're acting weird towards my sister.

326
00:20:14,790 --> 00:20:16,790
I thought it was some breaking news.

327
00:20:16,920 --> 00:20:18,240
They've been like this
since they were kids.

328
00:20:18,240 --> 00:20:20,700
Isn't this something
the whole world knows?

329
00:20:20,900 --> 00:20:21,380
Really?

330
00:20:24,920 --> 00:20:26,120
If it were you,

331
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:28,930
who would you choose between them?

332
00:20:29,310 --> 00:20:30,770
I wouldn't choose either.

333
00:20:32,720 --> 00:20:34,380
You have such high standards.

334
00:20:36,130 --> 00:20:38,010
I like mature ones.

335
00:20:41,940 --> 00:20:42,800
Are you picking

336
00:20:43,510 --> 00:20:45,310
a brother-in-law for yourself?

337
00:20:46,830 --> 00:20:49,500
Actually, as long as Lin Zhixia
likes him and he suits her,

338
00:20:49,500 --> 00:20:50,230
I don't mind.

339
00:20:53,330 --> 00:20:55,740
But Lin Zhixia's logical thinking

340
00:20:55,770 --> 00:20:57,430
is quite different from ours.

341
00:20:57,730 --> 00:20:59,330
How do you know who suits her?

342
00:20:59,500 --> 00:21:01,020
I know my sister well.

343
00:21:02,440 --> 00:21:05,360
I plan to give them the same question

344
00:21:05,840 --> 00:21:07,370
without a standard answer.

345
00:21:09,010 --> 00:21:10,140
When the time comes,

346
00:21:10,220 --> 00:21:12,680
it's up to Lin Zhixia
to choose between them.

347
00:21:14,270 --> 00:21:16,990
A screening test from the brother-in-law.

348
00:21:17,550 --> 00:21:18,350
It's not easy.

349
00:21:22,440 --> 00:21:23,640
By the way, Lin Zeqiu,

350
00:21:24,140 --> 00:21:25,740
let's take a photo together.

351
00:21:27,050 --> 00:21:28,660
As proof for your parents.

352
00:21:32,850 --> 00:21:33,180
Okay.

353
00:21:37,180 --> 00:21:38,030
Right here.

354
00:21:38,090 --> 00:21:38,500
Okay.

355
00:21:39,090 --> 00:21:40,700
Three, two, one.

356
00:21:46,770 --> 00:21:48,360
We don't look very close.

357
00:21:49,200 --> 00:21:50,540
Let's take another one.

358
00:21:50,790 --> 00:21:51,510
Get a little closer.

359
00:21:51,510 --> 00:21:51,940
Okay.

360
00:21:57,010 --> 00:21:58,310
Three, two, one.

361
00:22:01,010 --> 00:22:01,610
All right.

362
00:22:02,810 --> 00:22:03,410
Thank you.

363
00:22:04,160 --> 00:22:05,160
Have a seat first,

364
00:22:05,200 --> 00:22:06,530
food will be ready soon.

365
00:22:18,050 --> 00:22:18,580
How is it?

366
00:22:21,550 --> 00:22:22,480
It's delicious.

367
00:22:23,960 --> 00:22:25,110
Eat more if it's good.

368
00:22:25,110 --> 00:22:28,310
Eating school cafeteria food
all the time must be boring.

369
00:22:31,350 --> 00:22:33,150
Don't just watch me, you eat too.

370
00:22:34,880 --> 00:22:36,760
Right, I'll eat.

371
00:22:38,700 --> 00:22:41,230
I just saw a lot of
astronomy books on the desk.

372
00:22:41,360 --> 00:22:43,830
That you've kept this hobby
for so many years,

373
00:22:43,830 --> 00:22:44,960
I really admire you.

374
00:22:47,010 --> 00:22:48,350
Besides working every day,

375
00:22:48,350 --> 00:22:49,810
this is my only hobby left.

376
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:54,240
I don't seem to have any hobbies.

377
00:22:54,790 --> 00:22:56,320
I'm a pretty boring person.

378
00:22:58,000 --> 00:22:58,800
Not at all.

379
00:22:58,830 --> 00:23:00,760
I think you're quite interesting.

380
00:23:00,900 --> 00:23:02,630
You're so good at your studies.

381
00:23:03,290 --> 00:23:04,880
I remember you sing very well, too.

382
00:23:04,880 --> 00:23:05,640
Right?

383
00:23:12,180 --> 00:23:12,980
Tell me,

384
00:23:13,180 --> 00:23:15,910
what do you think about
when you look at the stars?

385
00:23:20,310 --> 00:23:21,960
It makes me feel very small.

386
00:23:24,920 --> 00:23:26,580
Only when I look up at the stars

387
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:29,920
can I find a moment of freedom.

388
00:23:32,150 --> 00:23:34,200
Aren't you free now?

389
00:23:36,680 --> 00:23:38,810
I think freedom is actually relative.

390
00:23:40,550 --> 00:23:42,680
Living in this society, we are bound by

391
00:23:43,030 --> 00:23:44,510
work, family,

392
00:23:44,510 --> 00:23:45,680
and social status.

393
00:23:45,830 --> 00:23:47,510
These things make us more or less

394
00:23:47,510 --> 00:23:49,370
connected with people around us.

395
00:23:52,070 --> 00:23:53,160
Just like stars.

396
00:23:54,350 --> 00:23:55,720
Actually, every star in the sky

397
00:23:55,720 --> 00:23:56,880
has its own orbit,

398
00:23:58,000 --> 00:23:59,440
but it also connects with

399
00:23:59,440 --> 00:24:00,550
all the stars around it

400
00:24:00,550 --> 00:24:02,610
to finally form the whole starry sky.

401
00:24:09,380 --> 00:24:10,330
Actually, I know

402
00:24:11,090 --> 00:24:13,350
you've always wanted to be independent.

403
00:24:14,850 --> 00:24:17,290
But only after you truly

404
00:24:17,290 --> 00:24:19,890
build connections
with the people around you,

405
00:24:20,570 --> 00:24:22,230
can you find your own freedom.

406
00:24:25,980 --> 00:24:26,900
I also hope

407
00:24:27,700 --> 00:24:29,430
I can become independent soon.

408
00:24:30,420 --> 00:24:32,420
You are very independent by nature.

409
00:24:37,900 --> 00:24:39,700
You have your own thoughts and opinions

410
00:24:39,700 --> 00:24:40,740
and never just follow the crowd.

411
00:24:40,740 --> 00:24:41,610
You do well in your studies,

412
00:24:41,610 --> 00:24:43,980
and are taking your favorite major
at a top university.

413
00:24:43,980 --> 00:24:46,640
You will definitely achieve
whatever you want.

414
00:24:47,980 --> 00:24:49,310
Everything you hope for

415
00:24:49,610 --> 00:24:50,940
is just a matter of time.

416
00:24:59,770 --> 00:25:01,100
I also want to thank you.

417
00:25:02,380 --> 00:25:03,380
Thank me for what?

418
00:25:04,140 --> 00:25:06,540
For helping me keep things
from my parents.

419
00:25:08,010 --> 00:25:09,500
You did me a huge favor.

420
00:25:11,810 --> 00:25:13,570
If you encounter any problems
in the future,

421
00:25:13,570 --> 00:25:14,970
you can always come to me.

422
00:25:16,420 --> 00:25:17,290
You said it.

423
00:25:18,810 --> 00:25:19,610
I did.

424
00:25:26,810 --> 00:25:27,530
Cheers.

425
00:25:35,050 --> 00:25:36,110
This is delicious.

426
00:25:40,780 --> 00:25:42,570
[Inpatient]

427
00:25:56,460 --> 00:25:58,610
It's time. You should go to sleep.

428
00:26:00,420 --> 00:26:02,220
I was too soft-hearted
to scold you last night,

429
00:26:02,220 --> 00:26:04,820
but don't stay up so late
looking at your phone.

430
00:26:04,940 --> 00:26:07,140
Dr. Shen, it's not that
I don't want to sleep,

431
00:26:07,140 --> 00:26:08,220
I really can't.

432
00:26:11,500 --> 00:26:12,700
You have two choices.

433
00:26:13,590 --> 00:26:14,420
One,

434
00:26:14,790 --> 00:26:16,450
turn off your phone and sleep.

435
00:26:16,720 --> 00:26:17,530
Two,

436
00:26:18,140 --> 00:26:20,540
let me prescribe
a sleep injection for you.

437
00:26:21,810 --> 00:26:23,270
I don't want an injection.

438
00:26:34,510 --> 00:26:35,510
You should go too.

439
00:26:47,930 --> 00:26:50,250
I got a pair of sleep-aid
earphones for you.

440
00:26:50,250 --> 00:26:51,750
I've downloaded some music in it.

441
00:26:51,750 --> 00:26:53,880
You can listen to it if you can't sleep.

442
00:26:54,680 --> 00:26:55,280
Thank you.

443
00:26:56,940 --> 00:26:57,700
I'm leaving.

444
00:27:05,090 --> 00:27:05,940
Rest early.

445
00:28:09,070 --> 00:28:09,740
Shen.

446
00:28:10,200 --> 00:28:10,510
Director.

447
00:28:10,510 --> 00:28:11,770
Go check on Shui.

448
00:28:12,140 --> 00:28:13,200
She's in a bad mood.

449
00:28:24,980 --> 00:28:27,140
I don't want to do the check-up anymore.

450
00:28:27,140 --> 00:28:28,850
I do it every single day.

451
00:28:29,010 --> 00:28:29,900
I'm tired.

452
00:28:45,000 --> 00:28:46,180
What is this?

453
00:28:46,440 --> 00:28:47,640
Are you coaxing a kid?

454
00:28:48,610 --> 00:28:50,610
I'll give it to you after the check-up.

455
00:28:50,610 --> 00:28:52,250
I don't even like pink.

456
00:28:55,400 --> 00:28:56,400
What about these?

457
00:28:58,150 --> 00:28:59,210
Pick for yourself.

458
00:28:59,510 --> 00:29:01,040
See if there's any you like.

459
00:29:05,850 --> 00:29:06,910
How many can I pick?

460
00:29:07,030 --> 00:29:08,080
One per check-up.

461
00:29:09,290 --> 00:29:10,410
Stingy.

462
00:29:12,070 --> 00:29:13,730
Then I must choose carefully.

463
00:29:18,200 --> 00:29:19,600
I'll take the lychee one.

464
00:29:21,220 --> 00:29:21,740
Wait,

465
00:29:21,810 --> 00:29:23,810
besides the daily check-ups,

466
00:29:23,980 --> 00:29:25,640
if I cooperate with the blood test

467
00:29:25,640 --> 00:29:26,570
and eat my meals,

468
00:29:26,570 --> 00:29:27,940
can I get one for each of those too?

469
00:29:27,940 --> 00:29:28,440
Yes.

470
00:29:30,510 --> 00:29:32,250
Come, sit up straight.

471
00:29:32,940 --> 00:29:33,700
Inhale.

472
00:29:36,940 --> 00:29:37,800
Exhale slowly.

473
00:29:46,700 --> 00:29:48,420
If I'm well-behaved on 10 occasions,

474
00:29:48,420 --> 00:29:50,080
can I exchange them for a wish?

475
00:29:50,880 --> 00:29:51,500
No.

476
00:29:53,180 --> 00:29:54,580
What about 30 occasions?

477
00:29:55,770 --> 00:29:57,640
Thirty occasions should do, right?

478
00:29:57,640 --> 00:29:58,620
I promise

479
00:29:58,700 --> 00:30:01,290
I will cooperate
with all the check-ups from now on.

480
00:30:01,290 --> 00:30:02,490
Please?

481
00:30:02,510 --> 00:30:03,710
Don't push your luck.

482
00:30:07,850 --> 00:30:10,180
Whatever, I'll take the lychee one first.

483
00:30:10,480 --> 00:30:12,610
Next time, I'll get the blueberry one.

484
00:30:19,790 --> 00:30:21,520
I'll be making rounds tonight.

485
00:30:21,590 --> 00:30:23,920
If you finish
that bottle of water by then,

486
00:30:25,180 --> 00:30:27,040
I'll reward you with another one.

487
00:30:33,740 --> 00:30:36,290
Come on, Shui,
let's draw some blood first.

488
00:30:39,590 --> 00:30:41,120
What's the meaning of this?

489
00:30:42,480 --> 00:30:44,010
This endorsement contract

490
00:30:44,070 --> 00:30:45,240
is waiting for your signature.

491
00:30:45,240 --> 00:30:46,850
Of course I know
it's an endorsement contract!

492
00:30:46,850 --> 00:30:47,770
I'm not blind.

493
00:30:48,510 --> 00:30:49,530
I just want to ask you

494
00:30:49,530 --> 00:30:51,790
why you won't hire Zhou Heng for 800,000,

495
00:30:51,900 --> 00:30:53,090
but insist on spending 1.2 million

496
00:30:53,090 --> 00:30:55,220
to hire some star for the endorsement?

497
00:30:55,500 --> 00:30:56,220
What else?

498
00:30:56,850 --> 00:30:58,420
Nowadays, every brand's technology,

499
00:30:58,420 --> 00:31:00,700
car models, and colors
are almost the same.

500
00:31:00,700 --> 00:31:03,560
The only thing we can compete on
is brand awareness.

501
00:31:04,440 --> 00:31:06,250
This star just started gaining fame.

502
00:31:06,250 --> 00:31:06,900
I'm telling you,

503
00:31:06,900 --> 00:31:08,940
I managed to negotiate a low price
with great difficulty.

504
00:31:08,940 --> 00:31:09,750
If you don't grab them now,

505
00:31:09,750 --> 00:31:12,210
it won't be this price
once they're popular.

506
00:31:12,250 --> 00:31:13,330
Sign it quickly.

507
00:31:13,740 --> 00:31:14,720
Don't ruin it.

508
00:31:20,290 --> 00:31:21,050
Fine.

509
00:31:22,030 --> 00:31:22,940
I can sign.

510
00:31:24,500 --> 00:31:26,500
But Zhou Heng must join the company.

511
00:31:31,070 --> 00:31:32,600
That's a different matter.

512
00:31:33,310 --> 00:31:34,010
He

513
00:31:34,500 --> 00:31:35,830
is really too expensive.

514
00:31:35,830 --> 00:31:36,500
Okay.

515
00:31:37,220 --> 00:31:38,940
Then let's follow the procedure

516
00:31:38,940 --> 00:31:41,200
and let the board of directors vote on it.

517
00:31:42,440 --> 00:31:43,090
Duan.

518
00:31:43,310 --> 00:31:44,640
For such a small matter,

519
00:31:44,750 --> 00:31:46,610
there's no need to make a big fuss.

520
00:31:47,140 --> 00:31:48,140
Besides,

521
00:31:48,440 --> 00:31:49,770
even if we vote,

522
00:31:50,440 --> 00:31:52,050
the result will be the same.

523
00:31:56,090 --> 00:31:56,770
Really?

524
00:31:57,570 --> 00:31:58,420
I don't buy it.

525
00:31:59,000 --> 00:32:00,860
How would we know without voting?

526
00:32:01,590 --> 00:32:03,010
If the voting result

527
00:32:03,010 --> 00:32:03,980
is as you said,

528
00:32:04,250 --> 00:32:05,250
I'll accept it.

529
00:32:07,060 --> 00:32:10,010
[Inpatient]

530
00:32:14,420 --> 00:32:15,140
Zeqiu.

531
00:32:16,680 --> 00:32:18,410
I was just about to call for you.

532
00:32:18,960 --> 00:32:21,290
The doctor has looked at Zhixia's X-rays.

533
00:32:21,640 --> 00:32:23,040
It's healing quite well.

534
00:32:23,160 --> 00:32:25,380
She should be able to go home
and rest in a couple of days.

535
00:32:25,380 --> 00:32:26,090
Really?

536
00:32:32,000 --> 00:32:33,250
Thanks for your hard work recently.

537
00:32:33,250 --> 00:32:34,510
You did so much for her.

538
00:32:34,980 --> 00:32:36,140
After she's discharged,

539
00:32:36,140 --> 00:32:38,310
Lin Zhixia and I will treat you to a meal.

540
00:32:38,310 --> 00:32:39,240
You're welcome.

541
00:32:43,640 --> 00:32:45,640
Even though she's getting discharged soon,

542
00:32:45,640 --> 00:32:46,810
I'm still worried.

543
00:32:48,480 --> 00:32:49,280
What's wrong?

544
00:32:50,740 --> 00:32:52,400
The fundamental problem
hasn't been solved.

545
00:32:52,400 --> 00:32:55,070
She's still under a lot of pressure
on this project.

546
00:32:55,070 --> 00:32:57,740
Both manpower
and resources are insufficient.

547
00:32:58,110 --> 00:33:01,370
I'm afraid she'll ruin her health again
when she goes back.

548
00:33:01,510 --> 00:33:03,170
I can't be of much help either.

549
00:33:06,240 --> 00:33:07,100
How about this?

550
00:33:07,350 --> 00:33:09,280
I'll go back and ask my mom tonight.

551
00:33:09,550 --> 00:33:10,420
I'll see

552
00:33:10,510 --> 00:33:11,420
if I can borrow

553
00:33:11,420 --> 00:33:13,880
two of her students
to help with the project.

554
00:33:14,010 --> 00:33:14,850
Borrow?

555
00:33:15,740 --> 00:33:16,670
Is that allowed?

556
00:33:19,330 --> 00:33:20,990
It shouldn't be a big problem.

557
00:33:23,350 --> 00:33:25,140
That would be great if it works.

558
00:33:25,160 --> 00:33:26,760
You're doing me a huge favor.

559
00:33:27,700 --> 00:33:29,770
I'll owe you another meal.

560
00:33:29,900 --> 00:33:30,850
We'll talk about

561
00:33:30,850 --> 00:33:32,110
what you want to eat later.

562
00:33:32,110 --> 00:33:32,810
Sure.

563
00:33:37,980 --> 00:33:38,610
Zeqiu.

564
00:33:38,920 --> 00:33:40,500
I'm going to get some food for Lin Zhixia.

565
00:33:40,500 --> 00:33:42,140
Do you want something to eat, too?

566
00:33:42,140 --> 00:33:43,500
I've already eaten. No need.

567
00:33:43,500 --> 00:33:45,160
Thanks for your hard work lately.

568
00:33:45,160 --> 00:33:46,940
I just talked to Shen Fuxuan.

569
00:33:46,960 --> 00:33:49,420
He said Lin Zhixia
can be discharged the day after tomorrow.

570
00:33:49,420 --> 00:33:50,220
That's great.

571
00:33:51,440 --> 00:33:53,240
I happen to be free
tomorrow and the day after.

572
00:33:53,240 --> 00:33:54,420
I can take care of her.

573
00:33:54,420 --> 00:33:56,020
You should get some rest too.

574
00:33:56,900 --> 00:33:57,660
Okay.

575
00:33:59,700 --> 00:34:00,380
Actually,

576
00:34:00,700 --> 00:34:03,430
I'm still quite worried
about her work right now.

577
00:34:03,440 --> 00:34:05,980
Her work pressure was already high before,

578
00:34:06,050 --> 00:34:07,310
and now she's injured.

579
00:34:08,110 --> 00:34:08,940
You also know

580
00:34:09,440 --> 00:34:11,230
that someone
has been targeting her recently.

581
00:34:11,230 --> 00:34:12,690
I was wondering if

582
00:34:12,690 --> 00:34:14,340
we could help her with this.

583
00:34:21,820 --> 00:34:22,460
Zeqiu.

584
00:34:23,440 --> 00:34:24,570
Actually, you should know Lin Zhixia

585
00:34:24,570 --> 00:34:25,969
better than anyone else.

586
00:34:26,920 --> 00:34:28,820
She is actually more independent

587
00:34:29,280 --> 00:34:30,690
and resilient than we imagine.

588
00:34:30,690 --> 00:34:31,860
She also knows better how to handle

589
00:34:31,860 --> 00:34:33,860
matters in her professional field.

590
00:34:34,090 --> 00:34:36,290
She was just a bit flustered a while ago,

591
00:34:36,690 --> 00:34:38,420
so what she needs most is rest

592
00:34:38,860 --> 00:34:40,690
to adjust her state and pace.

593
00:34:42,530 --> 00:34:43,860
If she and her team didn't

594
00:34:43,860 --> 00:34:45,940
achieve victory on their own in the end,

595
00:34:45,940 --> 00:34:48,070
it wouldn't be the outcome she wanted.

596
00:34:50,420 --> 00:34:52,199
So all we have to do is trust her,

597
00:34:52,690 --> 00:34:53,590
support her,

598
00:34:54,030 --> 00:34:55,830
and take good care of her health.

599
00:35:34,230 --> 00:35:35,630
Tang, what are you doing?

600
00:35:35,900 --> 00:35:37,190
Want to have some supper?

601
00:35:37,190 --> 00:35:38,900
Hot pot or barbecue, your pick.

602
00:35:38,900 --> 00:35:39,820
It's my treat.

603
00:35:40,340 --> 00:35:42,340
I'm in urgent need of a supper buddy.

604
00:36:37,940 --> 00:36:39,760
Sorry, we're closed.

605
00:36:41,300 --> 00:36:43,100
Then I'll come back another day.

606
00:36:44,830 --> 00:36:45,720
It's you.

607
00:36:46,550 --> 00:36:47,210
Have a seat.

608
00:36:48,050 --> 00:36:49,460
No, it's okay. I'll go look elsewhere.

609
00:36:49,460 --> 00:36:50,990
I'm not that hungry anyway.

610
00:36:51,530 --> 00:36:53,030
I'll go see what I can whip up.

611
00:36:53,030 --> 00:36:54,050
Please don't trouble yourself.

612
00:36:54,050 --> 00:36:56,170
I'm really not that hungry.
No need to trouble yourself.

613
00:36:56,170 --> 00:36:58,830
Grab whatever you want to drink
from the fridge.

614
00:37:02,510 --> 00:37:03,280
Okay.

615
00:37:09,130 --> 00:37:10,340
You worked so late,

616
00:37:10,340 --> 00:37:12,070
you didn't have dinner, right?

617
00:37:13,670 --> 00:37:15,530
I was thinking of having supper,

618
00:37:15,530 --> 00:37:16,990
but I had no one to eat with.

619
00:37:17,090 --> 00:37:19,940
Next time you work overtime,
you can order food from me.

620
00:37:19,940 --> 00:37:21,400
Didn't you say before that

621
00:37:21,610 --> 00:37:24,110
people who aren't enthusiastic
about eating are not right in the head?

622
00:37:24,110 --> 00:37:26,770
No matter how busy you are,
you still have to eat.

623
00:37:27,130 --> 00:37:28,460
You even remember that?

624
00:37:29,800 --> 00:37:32,460
Boss, it's all thanks to you today.

625
00:37:32,860 --> 00:37:34,530
If you hadn't taken me in,

626
00:37:34,630 --> 00:37:37,690
I would be eating instant noodles
and gnawing on bread.

627
00:37:39,690 --> 00:37:40,890
My name is Gao Yiyuan.

628
00:37:40,920 --> 00:37:42,320
You can call me Yuanyuan.

629
00:37:45,170 --> 00:37:45,910
I said,

630
00:37:46,170 --> 00:37:47,380
my name is Gao Yiyuan.

631
00:37:47,780 --> 00:37:49,180
You can call me Yuanyuan.

632
00:38:00,260 --> 00:38:01,260
This is all that's left.

633
00:38:01,260 --> 00:38:03,120
Make do with it. It's on the house.

634
00:38:03,400 --> 00:38:03,990
Thanks.

635
00:38:10,340 --> 00:38:13,810
[Tang Tingting]

636
00:38:10,420 --> 00:38:12,590
Bro, I'm already swamped,

637
00:38:12,590 --> 00:38:14,050
and you want me to join you for supper?

638
00:38:14,050 --> 00:38:15,780
I'm already full on suffering.

639
00:38:20,800 --> 00:38:22,150
I ordered some takeout for you.

640
00:38:22,150 --> 00:38:23,420
It'll be left at your door in a bit.

641
00:38:23,420 --> 00:38:25,320
I'll allow you to eat alone today.

642
00:38:46,670 --> 00:38:47,840
Bro, you're back.

643
00:38:55,760 --> 00:38:56,480
You're out.

644
00:38:57,440 --> 00:38:58,670
Yes, just got out.

645
00:38:59,190 --> 00:38:59,990
Master Jiang,

646
00:39:00,130 --> 00:39:02,500
I called you so many times,
but you didn't answer.

647
00:39:02,500 --> 00:39:04,360
So I had to wait for you at the door.

648
00:39:04,920 --> 00:39:05,590
How about

649
00:39:05,760 --> 00:39:06,760
we go grab a drink?

650
00:39:06,800 --> 00:39:07,550
No need.

651
00:39:08,780 --> 00:39:10,040
Just tell me what it is.

652
00:39:13,730 --> 00:39:14,530
Master Jiang,

653
00:39:15,090 --> 00:39:16,090
here's the thing.

654
00:39:16,300 --> 00:39:17,630
I just got a big order,

655
00:39:17,630 --> 00:39:18,920
but the demand is difficult to meet.

656
00:39:18,920 --> 00:39:19,760
So...

657
00:39:23,110 --> 00:39:24,510
The client contact list.

658
00:39:25,030 --> 00:39:25,760
Give it to me.

659
00:39:27,840 --> 00:39:28,840
The contact list?

660
00:39:29,820 --> 00:39:30,750
What do you mean?

661
00:39:37,940 --> 00:39:39,920
Master Jiang, I was wrong.

662
00:39:40,440 --> 00:39:42,020
I didn't expect this to happen.

663
00:39:42,020 --> 00:39:43,980
If I knew they were selling fake goods,

664
00:39:43,980 --> 00:39:46,840
I wouldn't have taken the job
even if they killed me.

665
00:39:50,070 --> 00:39:50,380
I...

666
00:39:51,730 --> 00:39:53,420
I saw you were in a hurry for money,

667
00:39:53,420 --> 00:39:55,220
and I was just trying to help you.

668
00:39:56,260 --> 00:39:57,070
I know.

669
00:39:57,840 --> 00:39:59,570
This has nothing to do with you.

670
00:39:59,940 --> 00:40:02,200
That's why I'm willing to talk to you now.

671
00:40:02,320 --> 00:40:04,180
You've known me for so many years.

672
00:40:05,030 --> 00:40:06,090
I won't do it again.

673
00:40:06,590 --> 00:40:08,320
Please give me another chance.

674
00:40:09,380 --> 00:40:12,510
You uploaded the video
of the shock diamond, didn't you?

675
00:40:13,710 --> 00:40:14,770
The shock diamond?

676
00:40:31,510 --> 00:40:33,370
I don't know anything about that.

677
00:40:33,550 --> 00:40:35,680
I checked the IP address of the upload.

678
00:40:39,900 --> 00:40:42,010
I just thought it was so amazing.

679
00:40:42,870 --> 00:40:44,420
I wanted to use it to drive traffic

680
00:40:44,420 --> 00:40:45,880
and promote our business.

681
00:40:46,460 --> 00:40:47,090
Look.

682
00:40:49,000 --> 00:40:51,590
The private messages in this account
are all from new clients.

683
00:40:51,590 --> 00:40:53,990
The big batch of orders
I just told you about

684
00:40:54,030 --> 00:40:55,760
all came from this new channel.

685
00:40:56,960 --> 00:40:57,780
Don't worry.

686
00:40:58,050 --> 00:41:00,150
I know you don't like to show your face.

687
00:41:00,150 --> 00:41:01,550
No one will know it's you.

688
00:41:10,210 --> 00:41:10,900
Cheng,

689
00:41:12,690 --> 00:41:14,090
thanks for your hard work

690
00:41:14,480 --> 00:41:15,410
all these years.

691
00:41:18,300 --> 00:41:20,160
But I have my own plans from now on.

692
00:41:20,340 --> 00:41:21,270
Our partnership

693
00:41:22,400 --> 00:41:23,340
ends here.

694
00:41:30,900 --> 00:41:32,430
I understand what you mean.

695
00:41:33,210 --> 00:41:34,940
I can give you the contact list.

696
00:41:35,090 --> 00:41:35,980
But please,

697
00:41:36,690 --> 00:41:38,020
do one last thing for me.

698
00:41:38,480 --> 00:41:40,410
You must help me finish this order.

699
00:41:40,710 --> 00:41:42,570
I still have to deliver the goods.

700
00:41:42,590 --> 00:41:44,550
That workload will take
at least half a month.

701
00:41:44,550 --> 00:41:46,010
I don't have time
to waste on that right now.

702
00:41:46,010 --> 00:41:47,650
But I really can't afford
to compensate for it.

703
00:41:47,650 --> 00:41:48,690
If this order falls through,

704
00:41:48,690 --> 00:41:49,500
on top of the previous fines,

705
00:41:49,500 --> 00:41:51,760
all my work over the past two years
will have been for nothing.

706
00:41:51,760 --> 00:41:53,020
Please, Master Jiang.

707
00:41:57,360 --> 00:41:58,560
I'm begging you, bro.

708
00:41:58,760 --> 00:41:59,570
Please.

709
00:42:04,360 --> 00:42:05,630
Give me the contact list,

710
00:42:05,630 --> 00:42:06,430
and I'll do it.

711
00:42:12,340 --> 00:42:12,670
Okay.

712
00:42:23,710 --> 00:42:26,360
I'll leave you to it.
I won't bother you anymore.

713
00:42:26,360 --> 00:42:27,050
Wait.

714
00:42:31,260 --> 00:42:32,190
Take your stuff.

715
00:42:35,440 --> 00:42:36,210
Don't come

716
00:42:37,960 --> 00:42:39,290
looking for me anymore.

717
00:43:00,990 --> 00:43:05,240
[Huacheng City Hejia Hospital]

718
00:43:01,960 --> 00:43:03,890
You picked the candidates so fast.

719
00:43:03,900 --> 00:43:04,900
So efficient.

720
00:43:06,360 --> 00:43:08,460
Both of them are top students
from the math department.

721
00:43:08,460 --> 00:43:09,570
When Zhixia is discharged
from the hospital,

722
00:43:09,570 --> 00:43:11,230
they can come help right away.

723
00:43:11,630 --> 00:43:13,130
Thank Professor Shen for me.

724
00:43:13,130 --> 00:43:18,990
[Huacheng City Hejia Hospital]

725
00:43:13,260 --> 00:43:13,690
Okay.

726
00:43:13,860 --> 00:43:14,590
I'm leaving.

727
00:43:18,000 --> 00:43:19,460
Your leg is almost healed.

728
00:43:20,190 --> 00:43:22,790
What are you going to do
with your math project?

729
00:43:22,860 --> 00:43:25,000
Luo Ying has been covering
for me for days.

730
00:43:25,000 --> 00:43:26,760
For the remaining important calculations,

731
00:43:26,760 --> 00:43:28,260
I have to go back to school
and handle them myself.

732
00:43:28,260 --> 00:43:29,060
What's wrong?

733
00:43:30,860 --> 00:43:33,860
Shen Fuxuan borrowed
two math Ph.D. students

734
00:43:34,340 --> 00:43:35,610
from his mom

735
00:43:36,050 --> 00:43:37,130
to help you sort things out together.

736
00:43:37,130 --> 00:43:38,730
Take a look at their resumes.

737
00:43:41,150 --> 00:43:41,900
No need.

738
00:43:43,210 --> 00:43:44,670
What do you mean "no need"?

739
00:43:48,010 --> 00:43:50,410
How can we bother
Professor Shen with this?

740
00:43:50,880 --> 00:43:52,090
Isn't this cheating?

741
00:43:53,400 --> 00:43:55,190
If I don't even have confidence

742
00:43:55,190 --> 00:43:56,010
in my own team members

743
00:43:56,010 --> 00:43:57,150
and have to ask for external help,

744
00:43:57,150 --> 00:43:59,350
what would they think if they found out?

745
00:44:00,510 --> 00:44:02,210
I know what I'm doing.

746
00:44:02,550 --> 00:44:04,060
Just stop worrying, okay?

747
00:44:05,550 --> 00:44:06,300
Alright.

748
00:44:10,210 --> 00:44:11,050
This guy...

749
00:44:11,050 --> 00:44:12,340
He's not just a guy,

750
00:44:12,690 --> 00:44:13,750
he's a mind reader.

751
00:44:13,900 --> 00:44:14,830
What did you say?

752
00:44:15,500 --> 00:44:17,530
Nothing. Your choice is my choice.

753
00:44:19,630 --> 00:44:21,170
Can you talk normally?

754
00:44:24,300 --> 00:44:26,030
Just eat. I have nothing to say.

755
00:44:30,690 --> 00:44:31,610
Weirdo.

756
00:44:55,340 --> 00:44:56,270
Why are you here?

757
00:44:57,170 --> 00:44:58,030
This is for you.

758
00:44:58,840 --> 00:45:00,460
Come to my house for dinner tonight.

759
00:45:00,460 --> 00:45:02,280
My grandparents came back from abroad.

760
00:45:02,280 --> 00:45:03,480
They want to meet you.

761
00:45:04,400 --> 00:45:05,050
Me?

762
00:45:05,710 --> 00:45:07,210
You have quite the influence.

763
00:45:07,210 --> 00:45:07,900
They usually

764
00:45:07,900 --> 00:45:09,230
don't come back easily.

765
00:45:11,900 --> 00:45:12,730
Um, I'm sorry.

766
00:45:12,730 --> 00:45:14,210
I suddenly have an emergency today.

767
00:45:14,210 --> 00:45:15,050
Let's talk about it next time.

768
00:45:15,050 --> 00:45:16,380
Thanks for the flowers.

769
00:45:18,630 --> 00:45:20,360
I'll contact you tonight then.

770
00:45:32,380 --> 00:45:32,860
Hello?

771
00:45:33,230 --> 00:45:33,940
Hello, Mom.

772
00:45:35,280 --> 00:45:37,080
Did you give my address to Li Zhe?

773
00:45:37,150 --> 00:45:37,950
What's wrong?

774
00:45:38,300 --> 00:45:39,380
You didn't reply
to his WeChat messages.

775
00:45:39,380 --> 00:45:40,260
If I didn't tell him,

776
00:45:40,260 --> 00:45:41,590
where would he find you?

777
00:45:41,900 --> 00:45:43,050
He told you, right?

778
00:45:43,050 --> 00:45:44,630
To go to his house for dinner tonight.

779
00:45:44,630 --> 00:45:45,530
I'm not going.

780
00:45:46,630 --> 00:45:48,130
Mom, didn't you want me
to focus on studies before?

781
00:45:48,130 --> 00:45:49,930
Why are you asking me to date now?

782
00:45:50,000 --> 00:45:52,780
Baihui, your dad and I have discussed it.

783
00:45:53,260 --> 00:45:55,860
You should do what's appropriate
for your stage in life.

784
00:45:55,860 --> 00:45:56,780
Right now,

785
00:45:56,780 --> 00:45:57,900
you should be dating

786
00:45:57,900 --> 00:45:59,360
and then getting married.

787
00:46:01,170 --> 00:46:03,130
So, just like choosing a university,

788
00:46:03,130 --> 00:46:04,610
you've chosen my dating
and marriage partner

789
00:46:04,610 --> 00:46:05,650
for me, right?

790
00:46:05,960 --> 00:46:08,500
Your dad and I didn't say
it has to be Li Zhe.

791
00:46:09,400 --> 00:46:10,330
But look around.

792
00:46:10,900 --> 00:46:12,460
Look at the people around you.

793
00:46:12,460 --> 00:46:14,780
Who is more suitable than him

794
00:46:15,070 --> 00:46:16,000
in every aspect?

795
00:46:17,480 --> 00:46:18,210
Besides,

796
00:46:18,380 --> 00:46:19,860
what's wrong with Li Zhe?

797
00:46:20,460 --> 00:46:22,780
Can you just get to know him?

798
00:46:23,210 --> 00:46:23,940
Fine.

799
00:46:24,570 --> 00:46:25,460
You're right.

800
00:46:26,050 --> 00:46:27,170
I should be dating.

801
00:46:28,900 --> 00:46:30,430
I already have a boyfriend.

802
00:46:30,590 --> 00:46:31,520
What did you say?

803
00:46:34,550 --> 00:46:35,900
I said, I have a boyfriend.

804
00:46:35,900 --> 00:46:37,900
So I won't be going
to his place for dinner.

805
00:46:37,900 --> 00:46:38,670
I see.

806
00:46:39,460 --> 00:46:41,800
You've gotten too big for your britches,
haven't you?

807
00:46:41,800 --> 00:46:43,460
I'm not talking to you anymore.

808
00:46:43,460 --> 00:46:44,530
Let your dad talk to you.

809
00:46:44,530 --> 00:46:45,260
I...

810
00:46:45,400 --> 00:46:46,780
Hello? Mom?

811
00:47:01,900 --> 00:47:03,940
Jiang Yubai, it's good you're here.

812
00:47:04,930 --> 00:47:06,130
What's wrong, Zeqiu?

813
00:47:06,440 --> 00:47:08,370
I have something at work tomorrow.

814
00:47:08,890 --> 00:47:09,690
Can you...

815
00:47:09,690 --> 00:47:11,650
It's fine. I'll take care of her tomorrow.

816
00:47:11,650 --> 00:47:12,730
I'll pick her up from the hospital.

817
00:47:12,730 --> 00:47:13,650
Okay.

818
00:47:13,860 --> 00:47:15,060
Sorry to trouble you.

819
00:47:15,360 --> 00:47:17,220
Don't go fooling around with her.

820
00:47:17,280 --> 00:47:17,940
I got it.

821
00:47:18,360 --> 00:47:19,290
I'm leaving now.

822
00:47:21,150 --> 00:47:22,460
She can't walk right now.

823
00:47:22,460 --> 00:47:23,990
How are you two going to eat?

824
00:47:24,210 --> 00:47:25,720
-I’ll cook for her.
-We…

825
00:47:25,900 --> 00:47:27,030
I'll make all 3 meals

826
00:47:27,050 --> 00:47:28,580
and ensure a balanced diet.

827
00:47:29,860 --> 00:47:31,570
Then what time will you go home?

828
00:47:31,570 --> 00:47:32,570
What time?

829
00:47:34,300 --> 00:47:35,700
Don't you have to go home?

830
00:47:36,400 --> 00:47:37,360
Yes, I do.

831
00:47:37,480 --> 00:47:39,280
I'll go back after making dinner.

832
00:47:39,280 --> 00:47:40,340
Zeqiu...

833
00:47:40,480 --> 00:47:41,690
We're just chatting.

834
00:47:42,400 --> 00:47:43,170
Well,

835
00:47:43,190 --> 00:47:44,090
after you get home every day,

836
00:47:44,090 --> 00:47:45,690
share your location with me.

837
00:47:45,710 --> 00:47:46,940
Share my location?

838
00:47:48,010 --> 00:47:49,380
Just kidding.

839
00:47:49,380 --> 00:47:50,420
But do it.

840
00:47:51,710 --> 00:47:52,820
I'm leaving.

841
00:48:08,590 --> 00:48:09,300
Sorry.

842
00:48:09,880 --> 00:48:10,670
I kept you waiting.

843
00:48:10,670 --> 00:48:12,330
It's fine. I just got here too.

844
00:48:13,780 --> 00:48:14,860
Let's go up first.

845
00:48:14,860 --> 00:48:15,730
Okay, let me carry this.

846
00:48:15,730 --> 00:48:16,860
It's fine. I got it.

847
00:48:24,090 --> 00:48:25,290
You can use this half.

848
00:48:26,460 --> 00:48:27,190
Is it enough?

849
00:48:27,290 --> 00:48:27,940
Yes.

850
00:48:28,670 --> 00:48:30,840
I don't usually tidy up,
so it's a bit messy.

851
00:48:30,840 --> 00:48:31,610
It's fine.

852
00:48:31,760 --> 00:48:32,710
Here.

853
00:48:32,710 --> 00:48:34,130
I'll hang your towel here.

854
00:48:34,130 --> 00:48:34,860
Okay.

855
00:48:46,900 --> 00:48:48,500
I'll leave this side for you.

856
00:49:08,570 --> 00:49:09,340
Thanks.

857
00:49:10,510 --> 00:49:11,420
No problem.

858
00:49:12,010 --> 00:49:12,730
It's fine.

859
00:49:13,150 --> 00:49:14,900
I think this is pretty good.

860
00:49:15,760 --> 00:49:16,820
If my parents call,

861
00:49:16,820 --> 00:49:17,950
you can cover for me.

862
00:49:24,000 --> 00:49:26,330
Actually, you're the one covering for me.

863
00:49:28,510 --> 00:49:29,940
I'll tell you the truth.

864
00:49:31,150 --> 00:49:34,570
My parents found a boyfriend for me.

865
00:49:34,570 --> 00:49:35,980
They want me to get married,

866
00:49:35,980 --> 00:49:37,580
so they found someone for me.

867
00:49:38,000 --> 00:49:39,860
I really didn't know what to do,

868
00:49:39,860 --> 00:49:40,760
so I...

869
00:49:44,670 --> 00:49:45,500
It's fine.

870
00:49:46,530 --> 00:49:47,130
It's fine.

871
00:49:47,130 --> 00:49:48,170
I think it's pretty good now.

872
00:49:48,170 --> 00:49:49,830
We're helping each other out.

873
00:49:50,360 --> 00:49:52,160
Let me know if you need anything.

874
00:49:57,650 --> 00:49:59,170
You'll sleep in the guest room.

875
00:49:59,170 --> 00:50:00,500
It's already tidied up.

876
00:50:00,510 --> 00:50:02,370
And Lin Zhixia rarely comes back,

877
00:50:02,710 --> 00:50:03,690
so it works out.

878
00:50:04,380 --> 00:50:05,010
Okay.

879
00:50:05,010 --> 00:50:05,690
Right.

880
00:50:06,190 --> 00:50:06,980
Thanks.

881
00:50:07,000 --> 00:50:07,860
No problem.

882
00:50:29,500 --> 00:50:30,300
Wait a minute.

883
00:50:31,260 --> 00:50:32,130
Give it to me.

884
00:50:55,050 --> 00:50:56,180
I can walk by myself.

885
00:51:15,330 --> 00:51:17,090
I think I have a fever.

886
00:51:18,400 --> 00:51:19,050
A fever?

887
00:52:00,380 --> 00:52:01,050
No fever.

888
00:52:05,320 --> 00:52:07,050
During my days in the hospital,

889
00:52:07,280 --> 00:52:07,900
I realized that

890
00:52:07,900 --> 00:52:09,670
the connection between Jiang Yubai and me

891
00:52:09,670 --> 00:52:12,170
had surpassed the linear model of X and Y,

892
00:52:12,690 --> 00:52:15,090
deviating from its preset trajectory.

893
00:52:16,000 --> 00:52:17,930
His boundless understanding of me

894
00:52:18,300 --> 00:52:20,900
had become an unpredictable
random variable,

895
00:52:21,590 --> 00:52:22,990
making our relationship

896
00:52:23,170 --> 00:52:26,130
an equation
that even calculus couldn't solve.
